(6117394, 900854, 119264, '<td valign="top">love the lighting and clarity of this pic, good job!</td>', 'love the lighting and clarity of this pic, good job!', '2010-08-04 11:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117395, 900772, 48268, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a depressing thought.</td>', 'Now there''s a depressing thought.', '2010-08-04 11:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117396, 901473, 119264, '<td valign="top">Very appealing to children, when you need them to take their medicine!</td>', 'Very appealing to children, when you need them to take their medicine!', '2010-08-04 11:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117416, 901477, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot. The catch-lights on each pill bubble are pleasing, and the depth of field really nightlights the one pill well. I could see this doing well as a stock photo.</td>', 'Nice clean shot. The catch-lights on each pill bubble are pleasing, and the depth of field really nightlights the one pill well. I could see this doing well as a stock photo.', '2010-08-04 11:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117418, 901489, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess this does meet the unique view of medicine :)<br/>I really like the colors in this photo, and the silhouette of the vulture adds mystery. But I don''t feel like it fits the theme well.</td>', 'Well, I guess this does meet the unique view of medicine :)I really like the colors in this photo, and the silhouette of the vulture adds mystery. But I don''t feel like it fits the theme well.', '2010-08-04 11:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117421, 901598, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. You did the B&amp;W well, which nice deep blacks and contrasting whites. However, I think this could have looked a bit nicer in color (just a guess).</td>', 'Nice idea. You did the B&W well, which nice deep blacks and contrasting whites. However, I think this could have looked a bit nicer in color (just a guess).', '2010-08-04 11:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117423, 901410, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great product shot. I unfortunately have to take a point off for that, as stock photo sites don''t seem to like product placement.<br/>Absolutely wonderful job with the lighting. I tried a a fizzing tablet shot and could get it right.</td>', 'Great product shot. I unfortunately have to take a point off for that, as stock photo sites don''t seem to like product placement.Absolutely wonderful job with the lighting. I tried a a fizzing tablet shot and could get it right.', '2010-08-04 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117429, 900772, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge. The splash of color in a cool scene is really inviting.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge. The splash of color in a cool scene is really inviting.', '2010-08-04 11:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117434, 901180, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Two things I think could have improved this shot: Less distracting background and diffused lighting. The second one could have been used to really brightness the scene, and hopefully avoid some of the reflections.</td>', 'Cute idea. Two things I think could have improved this shot: Less distracting background and diffused lighting. The second one could have been used to really brightness the scene, and hopefully avoid some of the reflections.', '2010-08-04 11:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117441, 901478, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmm, a very unique take on this challenge. I like the idea, and the composition (diagonal lines are very powerful). The one thing that concerns me is the over-exposed background, specifically how that light is leaking onto the hand and taking away the clean lines.</td>', 'Hmm, a very unique take on this challenge. I like the idea, and the composition (diagonal lines are very powerful). The one thing that concerns me is the over-exposed background, specifically how that light is leaking onto the hand and taking away the clean lines.', '2010-08-04 11:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117445, 901568, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how your right monitor has a kernel panic. That definitely adds to the context. The perspective and depth of field used is good. Having a product label is against what I see in stock sites (they like non-descript objets), so that may be hurting your score a bit.</td>', 'I like how your right monitor has a kernel panic. That definitely adds to the context. The perspective and depth of field used is good. Having a product label is against what I see in stock sites (they like non-descript objets), so that may be hurting your score a bit.', '2010-08-04 11:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117448, 901590, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool how you got droplets both coming in and going out. Good lighting and just the right amount of color.</td>', 'Very cool how you got droplets both coming in and going out. Good lighting and just the right amount of color.', '2010-08-04 11:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117449, 901280, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool use of the refractive properties of water. Magnifying that portion of the syringe adds a lot of interest. I like the light on this, and think it could do well as a stock photo.</td>', 'Very cool use of the refractive properties of water. Magnifying that portion of the syringe adds a lot of interest. I like the light on this, and think it could do well as a stock photo.', '2010-08-04 11:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117453, 900591, 48268, '<td valign="top">And the ones that mother gives you don''t do anything at all?</td>', 'And the ones that mother gives you don''t do anything at all?', '2010-08-04 11:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117458, 901436, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of off-centered vignetting to draw in the viewer. Overall, I like this. I would have only liked to see the bottle be lit up a bit more to show some of the details there (looks like the liquid has a few bubbles that could have added to the idea of viscosity..</td>', 'Good use of off-centered vignetting to draw in the viewer. Overall, I like this. I would have only liked to see the bottle be lit up a bit more to show some of the details there (looks like the liquid has a few bubbles that could have added to the idea of viscosity..', '2010-08-04 11:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117459, 901566, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge (and a good unique idea). Good placement of the spoon (entering the scene from the upper left). I do wish we could see a bit more detail in the sugar itself.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge (and a good unique idea). Good placement of the spoon (entering the scene from the upper left). I do wish we could see a bit more detail in the sugar itself.', '2010-08-04 11:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117461, 901180, 33736, '<td valign="top">The Blue Ones work best!  lolllllllllll</td>', 'The Blue Ones work best!  lolllllllllll', '2010-08-04 11:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117462, 901288, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well, this certainly qualifies for a unique take on "medicine." I think with the right website, this could actually do pretty well as a stock photo (under a different classification, perhaps).</td>', 'Well, this certainly qualifies for a unique take on "medicine." I think with the right website, this could actually do pretty well as a stock photo (under a different classification, perhaps).', '2010-08-04 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117463, 901539, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. I had thought of doing something with money, but could find a good way to do it subtly. The coins interspersed is a great way to do it.</td>', 'Very good idea. I had thought of doing something with money, but could find a good way to do it subtly. The coins interspersed is a great way to do it.', '2010-08-04 11:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117465, 901446, 114225, '<td valign="top">I knew someone would do this :)<br/>I like how you colored the photo to really accentuate the pills.</td>', 'I knew someone would do this :)I like how you colored the photo to really accentuate the pills.', '2010-08-04 11:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117467, 901318, 119264, '<td valign="top">Outstanding use of skill to draw viewers eye to subject and what a unique way of displaying Fish-Oil meds, Good Job!!!</td>', 'Outstanding use of skill to draw viewers eye to subject and what a unique way of displaying Fish-Oil meds, Good Job!!!', '2010-08-04 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117468, 901467, 119264, '<td valign="top">I like this pic....because that''s how I feel when I have to take my meds in the morning and at night.....not FUN! What an creative way to capture the message of "Too much of too many!"</td>', 'I like this pic....because that''s how I feel when I have to take my meds in the morning and at night.....not FUN! What an creative way to capture the message of "Too much of too many!"', '2010-08-04 11:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117469, 901477, 33736, '<td valign="top">POV could have been more diagonal, and at least some of the pills sharper.  I liked your concept, but execution didn''t quite make it.</td>', 'POV could have been more diagonal, and at least some of the pills sharper.  I liked your concept, but execution didn''t quite make it.', '2010-08-04 11:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117470, 901478, 119264, '<td valign="top">I like the clear message it gives!</td>', 'I like the clear message it gives!', '2010-08-04 11:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117471, 901445, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice execution on something I''m sure was more difficult than a standard water droplet shot. The angle of the spoon was a good choice.</td>', 'Nice execution on something I''m sure was more difficult than a standard water droplet shot. The angle of the spoon was a good choice.', '2010-08-04 11:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117472, 901439, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too much light-glare, but I love the black and gold richness of it.</td>', 'Too much light-glare, but I love the black and gold richness of it.', '2010-08-04 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117475, 901594, 114225, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew what this was (diabetes testing and insulin?). The un-recognisable aspect from some may hurt your score a little (not by me though!).<br/>Overall, I find this a great shot for the challenge. Could definitely see it used as a stock photo.</td>', 'I wish I knew what this was (diabetes testing and insulin?). The un-recognisable aspect from some may hurt your score a little (not by me though!).Overall, I find this a great shot for the challenge. Could definitely see it used as a stock photo.', '2010-08-04 11:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117476, 901435, 119264, '<td valign="top">Don''t we all wish we could fix ourselves naturally! Focus is strong, and easily identifiable.</td>', 'Don''t we all wish we could fix ourselves naturally! Focus is strong, and easily identifiable.', '2010-08-04 11:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117478, 900591, 33736, '<td valign="top">Gosh - did you just "age" yourself or what???!!!lollllllll   Neat photo!</td>', 'Gosh - did you just "age" yourself or what???!!!lollllllll   Neat photo!', '2010-08-04 11:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117481, 901269, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and decent lighting used here. One thing that is throwing me off a bit is the two types of pills laying around, but only the yellow ones in the bottle. I expect to see another bottle or both types in this one.</td>', 'Nice colors and decent lighting used here. One thing that is throwing me off a bit is the two types of pills laying around, but only the yellow ones in the bottle. I expect to see another bottle or both types in this one.', '2010-08-04 11:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117486, 901426, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for this challenge. Good mix of background and foreground elements. The only thing I would suggest for improvement is to reduce the amount of noise.</td>', 'Nice shot for this challenge. Good mix of background and foreground elements. The only thing I would suggest for improvement is to reduce the amount of noise.', '2010-08-04 11:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117487, 901568, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too much extra stuff in the image, but your concept was humorous and the important components were clearly shot.</td>', 'Too much extra stuff in the image, but your concept was humorous and the important components were clearly shot.', '2010-08-04 11:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117489, 900623, 33736, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - and right on the Challenge target!  9</td>', 'Beautiful shot - and right on the Challenge target!  9', '2010-08-04 11:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117495, 901467, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a creepy photo! The hand feels like it has rigor mortis set in.<br/>The soft lighting here is very good. And the over-head perspective really adds to the number of pills (feels like there are more than there probably are).</td>', 'This is a creepy photo! The hand feels like it has rigor mortis set in.The soft lighting here is very good. And the over-head perspective really adds to the number of pills (feels like there are more than there probably are).', '2010-08-04 11:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117499, 901148, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a really good product placement photo (I especially like the floating spoon). However, for stock photography, it seems like having product labels is frowned upon for legal reasons. Overall, I do like the shot.</td>', 'This is a really good product placement photo (I especially like the floating spoon). However, for stock photography, it seems like having product labels is frowned upon for legal reasons. Overall, I do like the shot.', '2010-08-04 11:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117500, 901062, 33736, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, but the white powder on the pills just make this flat.  Lots of noise also.</td>', 'Clever idea, but the white powder on the pills just make this flat.  Lots of noise also.', '2010-08-04 11:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117503, 901369, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very good/unique take on the challenge. I could see this being used as a stock photo.</td>', 'Very good/unique take on the challenge. I could see this being used as a stock photo.', '2010-08-04 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117506, 901559, 33736, '<td valign="top">Ewwwwwwwwwwwweeee!!!!  Love the title!</td>', 'Ewwwwwwwwwwwweeee!!!!  Love the title!', '2010-08-04 11:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117507, 900270, 114225, '<td valign="top">At first, I didn''t like the extreme tilt. But as I looked at the photo more, I felt it did add to the scene.<br/>I''m thinking this wouldn''t make it as a stock photo in the medicine category, but it is an interesting shot.</td>', 'At first, I didn''t like the extreme tilt. But as I looked at the photo more, I felt it did add to the scene.I''m thinking this wouldn''t make it as a stock photo in the medicine category, but it is an interesting shot.', '2010-08-04 11:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117510, 901270, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very stock photo-like. I think it was a great idea to include the background bottle. That adds a little bit more interest and color to the scene.</td>', 'Very stock photo-like. I think it was a great idea to include the background bottle. That adds a little bit more interest and color to the scene.', '2010-08-04 11:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117511, 901148, 33736, '<td valign="top">Wish the bottle were a little straighter (vertically), but nice, clean, &amp; bright shot.</td>', 'Wish the bottle were a little straighter (vertically), but nice, clean, & bright shot.', '2010-08-04 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117515, 901259, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective, and a good assortment of color in those pills. I really like the lighting and the amount of texture we can see. I think this would do well at a stock site.</td>', 'Cool perspective, and a good assortment of color in those pills. I really like the lighting and the amount of texture we can see. I think this would do well at a stock site.', '2010-08-04 11:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117518, 901590, 33736, '<td valign="top">Ready-to-use shot!  An advertising agency''s dream.</td>', 'Ready-to-use shot!  An advertising agency''s dream.', '2010-08-04 12:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117524, 901605, 114225, '<td valign="top">This feels like a good stock-photo like shot.  Nice plain background and good lighting. The one thng that is throwing me off is the strange dark spot to the right of the spilled pills.</td>', 'This feels like a good stock-photo like shot.  Nice plain background and good lighting. The one thng that is throwing me off is the strange dark spot to the right of the spilled pills.', '2010-08-04 12:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117526, 901596, 33736, '<td valign="top">The lines (wires?) going across the bottom and top are rather distracting.  The title did help tie your subject to the theme.</td>', 'The lines (wires?) going across the bottom and top are rather distracting.  The title did help tie your subject to the theme.', '2010-08-04 12:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117527, 901603, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done! I can definitely foresee this doing well as a stock photo. A lot of interest, and good use of depth of field.</td>', 'Very well done! I can definitely foresee this doing well as a stock photo. A lot of interest, and good use of depth of field.', '2010-08-04 12:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
