(6117851, 901473, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice set of hues. I like the basic-ness of this, and could see it being successful as a stock photo.<br/>Is is just me, of is there a slight slope downward from left to right? If so, that might be hurting your score slightly (not from me).</td>', 'Very nice set of hues. I like the basic-ness of this, and could see it being successful as a stock photo.Is is just me, of is there a slight slope downward from left to right? If so, that might be hurting your score slightly (not from me).', '2010-08-04 14:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117852, 901425, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at this shot. Filling much of the frame with your subject and having a nice clean background means you are on track. There are a couple things I would suggest for improvement:<br/> - Less noise in the image<br/> - Faster shutter speed to eliminate the blur<br/> - Try different lighting so there isn''t a bright reflection in the spoon</td>', 'Good attempt at this shot. Filling much of the frame with your subject and having a nice clean background means you are on track. There are a couple things I would suggest for improvement: - Less noise in the image - Faster shutter speed to eliminate the blur - Try different lighting so there isn''t a bright reflection in the spoon', '2010-08-04 14:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117853, 901604, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good setup, colors, and reflections. I think it would be a good idea to try some different lighting techniques to reduce the bright reflections. To be a stock photo, you may also need to not have the text showing, as most stock sites don''t seem to like advertisement type shots.</td>', 'Good setup, colors, and reflections. I think it would be a good idea to try some different lighting techniques to reduce the bright reflections. To be a stock photo, you may also need to not have the text showing, as most stock sites don''t seem to like advertisement type shots.', '2010-08-04 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117869, 901601, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. A very unique shot with a good message that I can see being used in stock sites.<br/>One suggestion I would have is to use a slightly larger depth of field to ensure the entire salt shaker has focus.</td>', 'I like this. A very unique shot with a good message that I can see being used in stock sites.One suggestion I would have is to use a slightly larger depth of field to ensure the entire salt shaker has focus.', '2010-08-04 14:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117874, 901444, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice clean photo with good reflections and good details. The one thing that I could really use is a bit more context. I don''t think a handful of white pills holds a lot of interest for many people.</td>', 'Nice clean photo with good reflections and good details. The one thing that I could really use is a bit more context. I don''t think a handful of white pills holds a lot of interest for many people.', '2010-08-04 14:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117879, 901549, 114225, '<td valign="top">Darkness is the depression cure? I am not following this one at all.<br/>While I think maybe it could make it to a stock photo site, I don''t think it would make it in the Medicine category.</td>', 'Darkness is the depression cure? I am not following this one at all.While I think maybe it could make it to a stock photo site, I don''t think it would make it in the Medicine category.', '2010-08-04 14:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117881, 900854, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool setup. The background adds nice context to the photo. Good soft lighting used.</td>', 'Cool setup. The background adds nice context to the photo. Good soft lighting used.', '2010-08-04 14:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117884, 901165, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very good image for this challenge. Nice even/soft lighting, with good props, and great details.</td>', 'Very good image for this challenge. Nice even/soft lighting, with good props, and great details.', '2010-08-04 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117889, 900706, 114225, '<td valign="top">You like this nicely, and I am sure you had fun with the setup. It definitely meets the medicine part, but I don''t think it would make it as a stock photo. My suggestions:<br/> - Get in tighter to provide more details, and remove distracting elements such as the carpet<br/> - I would say remove the non-medical tools. They add to the fun, but I think the mad scientist is enough for stock without getting other strange objects in there</td>', 'You like this nicely, and I am sure you had fun with the setup. It definitely meets the medicine part, but I don''t think it would make it as a stock photo. My suggestions: - Get in tighter to provide more details, and remove distracting elements such as the carpet - I would say remove the non-medical tools. They add to the fun, but I think the mad scientist is enough for stock without getting other strange objects in there', '2010-08-04 14:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117891, 901244, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very good entry for this challenge. I am certain it would be accepted into a stock site, and the little droplet of medicine adds some extra interest.</td>', 'Very good entry for this challenge. I am certain it would be accepted into a stock site, and the little droplet of medicine adds some extra interest.', '2010-08-04 14:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117893, 901318, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute photo/idea. I can actually see this being used as a stock photo, in the medicine category (especially after looking over different sites for this challenge).</td>', 'Cute photo/idea. I can actually see this being used as a stock photo, in the medicine category (especially after looking over different sites for this challenge).', '2010-08-04 14:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117898, 901062, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cute idea! To make this really effective (especially as a stock photo), I think you need to clean it up just a bit. Less noise, non-reflective background, no white spots on the pills. Make those changes, and you have a really good stock photo.</td>', 'What a cute idea! To make this really effective (especially as a stock photo), I think you need to clean it up just a bit. Less noise, non-reflective background, no white spots on the pills. Make those changes, and you have a really good stock photo.', '2010-08-04 14:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117902, 900531, 114225, '<td valign="top">Boring, but effective. :)<br/>Definitely seems like it would be a good stock photo, and I do like how you colored it.</td>', 'Boring, but effective. :)Definitely seems like it would be a good stock photo, and I do like how you colored it.', '2010-08-04 14:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117907, 900895, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a good attempt, with nice soft lighting and great clarity. To make it really good for stock photo use, I would suggest:<br/> - Not having product placement, as stock sites normally don''t allow "advertisement" photos<br/> - A perspective that is lower, especially so you don''t see the broken foul at the top of the bottle<br/> - Maybe more interested placement, such as next to an alarm clock.</td>', 'This is a good attempt, with nice soft lighting and great clarity. To make it really good for stock photo use, I would suggest: - Not having product placement, as stock sites normally don''t allow "advertisement" photos - A perspective that is lower, especially so you don''t see the broken foul at the top of the bottle - Maybe more interested placement, such as next to an alarm clock.', '2010-08-04 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117909, 900640, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors of this one. Nice clarity as well. My one main suggestion would be to have a bit more light coming in from the right.</td>', 'I really like the colors of this one. Nice clarity as well. My one main suggestion would be to have a bit more light coming in from the right.', '2010-08-04 14:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117911, 901602, 114225, '<td valign="top">First off, you have a very good photo here. Excellent details, nice soft lighting, good story, and good depth of field. So I definitely like it.<br/> <br/>However, this being a stock challenge, I don''t think an "advertisement" type shot would really fit well. Unfortunately, without the advertisement (say it was a blank bottle), this photo could come across as very depressing. That''s quite the double edged sword.</td>', 'First off, you have a very good photo here. Excellent details, nice soft lighting, good story, and good depth of field. So I definitely like it. However, this being a stock challenge, I don''t think an "advertisement" type shot would really fit well. Unfortunately, without the advertisement (say it was a blank bottle), this photo could come across as very depressing. That''s quite the double edged sword.', '2010-08-04 14:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117913, 901272, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great photo for this challenge. I can definitely see this being successful at a stock photo site. There is good soft lighting used, and proper depth of field to add context but not distractions.</td>', 'Great photo for this challenge. I can definitely see this being successful at a stock photo site. There is good soft lighting used, and proper depth of field to add context but not distractions.', '2010-08-04 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117915, 901340, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo! Well done all around (lighting, composition, clarity, message). I can see this being very popular at a stock photo site.</td>', 'Very cool photo! Well done all around (lighting, composition, clarity, message). I can see this being very popular at a stock photo site.', '2010-08-04 14:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
