(6118834, 900854, 66398, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this one. Very stock photo like. I think it might be better though if the pills were more random rather than lined up. I do see why you did it (mimicking the shape of the DNA helix) but imho this would be stronger if the pills were more randomly placed. Also with such a shallow dof it is difficult to know where to get the good focus point. Where you have the most focus is near the center with the pills going away but in this particular shot and angle I think the two pills in the left front should have the most focus. they are more prominent and draw my eye already except they are not in focus. Another way that could be fixed is to use a slightly larger dof.<br/> <br/>Overall I think this is a wonderful photo and idea for this challenge. Initially it was my thought that it would be on the front page until noticed dof/focus point wasn''t quite right. Not voting but if I were I''d give it a 7 overall.</td>', 'I love the idea of this one. Very stock photo like. I think it might be better though if the pills were more random rather than lined up. I do see why you did it (mimicking the shape of the DNA helix) but imho this would be stronger if the pills were more randomly placed. Also with such a shallow dof it is difficult to know where to get the good focus point. Where you have the most focus is near the center with the pills going away but in this particular shot and angle I think the two pills in the left front should have the most focus. they are more prominent and draw my eye already except they are not in focus. Another way that could be fixed is to use a slightly larger dof. Overall I think this is a wonderful photo and idea for this challenge. Initially it was my thought that it would be on the front page until noticed dof/focus point wasn''t quite right. Not voting but if I were I''d give it a 7 overall.', '2010-08-05 02:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118835, 901294, 66398, '<td valign="top">This looks like a winning shot. Not sure about the title but this definitely looks like a stock photo to me.</td>', 'This looks like a winning shot. Not sure about the title but this definitely looks like a stock photo to me.', '2010-08-05 02:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118836, 901603, 66398, '<td valign="top">This will be on the front page. Love the angle and dof.</td>', 'This will be on the front page. Love the angle and dof.', '2010-08-05 02:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118838, 901436, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure the vignette is helpful. Dof and focus point is great. Maybe if the vignette was the other direction making the corners whiter then it would be more useful as a stock photo. Overall the image is great though.</td>', 'Not sure the vignette is helpful. Dof and focus point is great. Maybe if the vignette was the other direction making the corners whiter then it would be more useful as a stock photo. Overall the image is great though.', '2010-08-05 02:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118840, 901601, 66398, '<td valign="top">good idea and well done. I could see this used as a stock photo. Not voting but if I were I''d give it an 8</td>', 'good idea and well done. I could see this used as a stock photo. Not voting but if I were I''d give it an 8', '2010-08-05 02:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
