(6118844, 900623, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is definitely the best of the two herb shots in this challenge. Looks like front page material to me. The white on white is perfectly done and makes it easy to use as a stock photo. (not voting)</td>', 'This is definitely the best of the two herb shots in this challenge. Looks like front page material to me. The white on white is perfectly done and makes it easy to use as a stock photo. (not voting)', '2010-08-05 02:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
