(6131266, 900749, 58785, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/> <br/>Lets start with the challenge itself. "Stock photos Medicine", matches to this challenge, however if I needed a stock photo about medicine, I probably would not buy this one. I don''t think idea is wrong, but it is pretty much cheesy shot.<br/> <br/>Technically it''s ok. Probably too much vignette and some hue problems.<br/> <br/>Personal note: I would have a long sleeve shirt, probably white, like the doctors, and just get rid of the pills in the cup. Vignette is not necessary here, and I would also keep the distance between the top hand and the cup a little closer. I checked your portfolio, you just started, young person who has lots of time, so don''t get discouraged by guys like me. I am sure you will do better very soon :o)<br/> <br/>Leo</td>', 'Hi, Lets start with the challenge itself. "Stock photos Medicine", matches to this challenge, however if I needed a stock photo about medicine, I probably would not buy this one. I don''t think idea is wrong, but it is pretty much cheesy shot. Technically it''s ok. Probably too much vignette and some hue problems. Personal note: I would have a long sleeve shirt, probably white, like the doctors, and just get rid of the pills in the cup. Vignette is not necessary here, and I would also keep the distance between the top hand and the cup a little closer. I checked your portfolio, you just started, young person who has lots of time, so don''t get discouraged by guys like me. I am sure you will do better very soon :o) Leo', '2010-08-16 03:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6131621, 901565, 62895, '<td valign="top">It may not be a stock photo, but expressions are really funny. These two look like clowns. :-)</td>', 'It may not be a stock photo, but expressions are really funny. These two look like clowns. :-)', '2010-08-16 12:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
