(6133421, 900772, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>I can''t believe this didn''t finish top 10 in this challenge.  This was my favourite image in either of the stock photo open challenges.  Love the processing/colour, composition and great use of DOF.  The pill could have been a little sharper, and you would have had a 10 from me, but it had to settle for a 9 and this MUAIMHO.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  I can''t believe this didn''t finish top 10 in this challenge.  This was my favourite image in either of the stock photo open challenges.  Love the processing/colour, composition and great use of DOF.  The pill could have been a little sharper, and you would have had a 10 from me, but it had to settle for a 9 and this MUAIMHO.', '2010-08-18 01:13:18.000000', NULL, 0),
